        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion E F4, River Rock Entry Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith a simple design, Fusion Hardware's River Rock Entry Set is a great way to add a rustic touch to your doors. Nothing specifically about it alludes to the natural elements; but there is an organic ambience to this handleset that makes it feel warmer than traditional bronze door hardware. It is made out of true bronze with over 90 percent copper content. Available in either a dark bronze or the less dark medium bronze finish, it will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the River Rock Entry Set Fusion F4:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist that eliminates \"knob wobble\".</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rustic Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob on both the inside and the outside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</B> This is a non-functional piece for looks only used to match trim for inactive door. It does not latch and it does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish. </i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "River Rock Sandcast Bronze Entry Plate, Fusion E-F4",
                "description": "River Rock Sandcast Bronze Keyed Entry Plate Fusion E-F4 - With a simple design, Fusion Hardware's River Rock Entry Set is a great way to add a rustic touch to your doors. Nothing specifically about it alludes to the natural elements; but there is an organic ambience to this handleset that makes it feel warmer than traditional bronze door hardware. It is made out of true bronze with over 90 percent copper content. Available in either a dark bronze or the less dark medium bronze finish, it will fit all standard 5-1/2 inch on center door borings.",
